text Naranja_Safari_G26_M03_Text_081C3A56 {
    "You still have time left. Would you like\nto exit the SAFARI ZONE now?"
}

text Naranja_Safari_G26_M03_Text_081C3A9C {
    "Please enjoy the rest of your wild\nadventure!"
}

text Naranja_Safari_G26_M03_Text_081C3ACA {
    "Okay.\pI’ll take back your remaining SAFARI\nBALLS.\pThank you for playing.\nWe hope to see you again."
}

text Naranja_Safari_G26_M03_Text_081C3B2D {
    "Good luck!\pIf you need anything, don’t hesitate\nto tell me, please!"
}

text Naranja_Safari_G26_M03_Text_081C3B71 {
    "Did you know?\pIf you put a オカキクケ in that square box,\nPOKéMON gather around."
}

text Naranja_Safari_G26_M03_Text_081C3BBD {
    "I want to keep going deeper, but I\nforgot to bring a BIKE.\pSomething tells me that rare POKéMON\nlive in the outlying areas."
}

text Naranja_Safari_G26_M03_Text_081C3DCE {
    "I put a オカキクケ on the オカキクケ FEEDER.\nBut it seems to have disappeared.\pI guess POKéMON must have eaten it\nwithout me noticing."
}
